  "project_description": "This module enhances the add paragraphs modal.\n\nMaking it possible to categorize paragraph types and providing a better layout in the modal when adding new paragraphs.\n\n Features \n \n Install the module \n Navigate to a content entity that has paragraphs with a widget that has the modal add method \n \n Mentions \n This module is heavily inspired by the Paragraphs Editor Enhancements module.\n\nThe goal was to have a similar module, but lighter in functionality. Code of that module has been used as a base for this one.\n\n Back to top",
